{"key": "[\"Kanishka's coins carry Greek, Iranian and Indian gods side by side, and among them, the Buddha. At Mathura in red sandstone, and in Gandhara in grey schist, sculptors give the Buddha a human form, in some of his earliest images. Of Kanishka, a statue survives in a long Central Asian coat. Its head is gone.\", \"sarvam:varun_en_suspense@en-IN\", \"+6%\", \"+0Hz\", {}, \"fx5\"]", "mp3": "/Users/saidevdhal/Desktop/Codes/indianepics/public/audio/en/kanishka-mathura.mp3", "duration": 21.801083, "words": [{"t": 0.0, "d": 0.39638332727272724, "w": "Kanishka's"}, {"t": 0.39638332727272724, "d": 0.39638332727272724, "w": "coins"}, {"t": 0.7927666545454545, "d": 0.39638332727272724, "w": "carry"}, {"t": 1.1891499818181817, "d": 0.39638332727272724, "w": "Greek,"}, {"t": 1.585533309090909, "d": 0.39638332727272724, "w": "Iranian"}, {"t": 1.9819166363636362, "d": 0.39638332727272724, "w": "and"}, {"t": 2.3782999636363633, "d": 0.39638332727272724, "w": "Indian"}, {"t": 2.7746832909090906, "d": 0.39638332727272724, "w": "gods"}, {"t": 3.171066618181818, "d": 0.39638332727272724, "w": "side"}, {"t": 3.567449945454545, "d": 0.39638332727272724, "w": "by"}, {"t": 3.9638332727272725, "d": 0.39638332727272724, "w": "side,"}, {"t": 4.360216599999999, "d": 0.39638332727272724, "w": "and"}, {"t": 4.756599927272727, "d": 0.39638332727272724, "w": "among"}, {"t": 5.152983254545454, "d": 0.39638332727272724, "w": "them,"}, {"t": 5.549366581818181, "d": 0.39638332727272724, "w": "the"}, {"t": 5.9457499090909085, "d": 0.39638332727272724, "w": "Buddha."}, {"t": 6.342133236363636, "d": 0.39638332727272724, "w": "At"}, {"t": 6.738516563636363, "d": 0.39638332727272724, "w": "Mathura"}, {"t": 7.13489989090909, "d": 0.39638332727272724, "w": "in"}, {"t": 7.531283218181818, "d": 0.39638332727272724, "w": "red"}, {"t": 7.927666545454545, "d": 0.39638332727272724, "w": "sandstone,"}, {"t": 8.324049872727272, "d": 0.39638332727272724, "w": "and"}, {"t": 8.720433199999999, "d": 0.39638332